*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
*7 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.
