*Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Marching Kory]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 6~6.33 seconds<sup>180f~190f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 6~6.33 seconds<sup>180f~190f</sup>.
