==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*Despite them having been completely replaced by the [[War on Valentines#War on Valentines|War on Valentines]] stages in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]], [[Mallow March]], Marzi Pain and [[Cavity Creeping]] can still be seen in the example screenshot for the [[Timed Score Reward|Timed Score]] Stages section of the main help page.

